tains \\n, which is escaped as the characters backslash and n in JSON. That's correct.\n\nWe should confirm the code is syntactically correct. It is.\n\nThus final answer."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1485,"completion_tokens":1919,"total_tokens":3404,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1408},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1820},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1408,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":77},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}